Package: xiaomi-mipps-auth
Architecture: arm64
Depends: python3, bubblewrap, systemd, udev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Main fuel-gauge authentication for Xiaomi marble
 Runs the phone's original battery verifier in isolation when the ADSP
 battery manager becomes available and when a USB-C partner is attached.
 Requires the marble qcom_battmgr fuel-gauge interface and an Android
 runtime prepared locally from the phone's own vendor files.
